  "body": "Triple School Zone Prestige: In-zone for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and Bucklands Beach Primary School.\r\n\r\nDiscover modern coastal living in these beautifully designed, brand-new homes, just a short stroll from the beach in one of East Auckland's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to Bucklands Beach Domain, Bucklands Beach Primary School, the scenic coastal walkway to Half Moon Bay, and Howick Golf Club. Half Moon Bay Marina is just minutes away, offering cafés, restaurants, a gym, supermarkets and ferry services to Auckland's CBD.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this home offers:\r\n\r\n* Freehold No body cope no society Fee with Master build warranty \r\n* 3 +1 Study & bedrooms with and a bathroom downstairs. \r\n* Family bathroom upstairs and two bedrooms downstairs \r\n* One allocated car park\r\n* Heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area \r\n* Quality kitchen appliances, including an oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher and waste disposal unit\r\n* Alarm system, double glazed window \r\n\r\nA sophisticated new home, beautiful sea views, exceptional coastal location and excellent school zoning - this is Eastern Beach living at its best.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Property Guru or RPNZ, Auckland Council (LIM), or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or Harcourts, Ignite Realty Ltd. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
